ren":["Use the Force"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Use_the_Force","referenceId":"reference:74883d1dd46b87fe"}," check equals or exceeds the target’s ",{"tag":"a","children":["Fortitude Defense"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Fortitude_Defense"},", the target takes 6d6 points of damage and can only take a single ",{"tag":"a","children":["Swift Action"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Swift_Action"}," on their next turn. Otherwise, the target takes half damage and may act normally, and you may not maintain the power. Targets larger than Medium add a size modifier to ",{"tag":"a","children":["Fortitude Defense"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Fortitude_Defense"}," against this ",{"tag":"a","children":["Force Power"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Force_Power"},": Colossal +50, Gargantuan +20, Huge +10, Large +5.\n"]}]}]}]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Special:"]}," You may maintain your concentration on the targeted creature to continue damaging it from round to round. Maintaining the ",{"tag":"i","children":["Force Grip"]}," Power is a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Standard Action"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Standard_Action"},", and you must make a new ",{"tag":"a","children":["Use the Force"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Use_the_Force","referenceId":"reference:74883d1dd46b87fe"}," check each round. If you suffer damage while maintaining a ",{"tag":"i","children":["Force Grip"]},", you must succeed on a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Use the Force"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Use_the_Force","referenceId":"reference:74883d1dd46b87fe"}," check (DC = 15 + damage taken) to continue concentrating.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["You can spend a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Force Point"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Force_Point"}," to deal an additional 2d6 points of damage with your ",{"tag":"i","children":["Force Grip"]},".\n"]},"\n","\n","\n","\n\n","\n\n","\n"]}}
